    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39839" root="نشط" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْشَطٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing on account of which,</i> or <i>to do
which, one is brisk, lively, sprightly,</i> or <i>active;</i> or
<i>pleased, cheerful,</i> or <i>happy; and which one likes,</i>
or <i>prefers, to do:</i> opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْرَهٌ</span>. (TA.)

